{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）上午10時39分，一名女子報案，指在觀塘成業街19號成業工業大廈一單位發現有大量龜、魚和蜥蜴斃命。警員及愛護動物協會人員到場調查。</p><p>現場消息稱，女業主在執達主任協助下到來收樓，其間發現有大量爬蟲類動物斃命，初步點算有20隻龜、兩隻蜥蝪和兩條魚。</p><figure><img alt=\"單位內有多個魚缸。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192445812253134848053187.jpeg/gi7L-DNV2CLJyYbD5y7zx0Tbq5dC8caq7EL8z-xC_M8\"/><figcaption>單位內有多個魚缸。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是成業工業大廈一個單位。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444112461107200703916.jpeg/0wUrCbV70QEjCEHH4RAbnY2yI3JhOBLFVoIOs1aCDrM\"/><figcaption>現場是成業工業大廈一個單位。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"愛護動物協會人員到場了解。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192450361453973504659732.jpeg/xx7Li69i8iR9Q6uJFq_mapL33yA-6JCgLkNDbQRDQ20\"/><figcaption>愛護動物協會人員到場了解。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在單位內調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444454032642048387651.jpeg/2T52Y8VlnKH204ugWe_wGZenXWgZKIvsihUB7IoVAew\"/><figcaption>警員在單位內調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444456675184640801794.jpeg/xLwQlDOaZJe2t3vQMKC81Yvmzk5bx_2cMN9s8DDfbPA\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444459372253184780421.jpeg/aMzVYZFAZWXKdGWgw30YHvqJGZnbxpm6COrD6Ajqw-g\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女業主收樓時揭發事件。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444462119653376219837.jpeg/X1V2xCHBpfwBP-o9I2wxTlSI2kIAlIfMeGt2T3hrdk8\"/><figcaption>女業主收樓時揭發事件。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444464892219392254169.jpeg/T-JPZ8dKcACakaygWWv1MPMNhZ1WirGDRPPWFUTz1hU\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:21:26.448670+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:54:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:33.754852+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:18:28.252820+00:00","content_hash":"2514b77fb6918171087108786c7c658f8269815de4780cbf7ce5a6dc43089bdf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}